 Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I must say that one of my greatest disappointments from Hunter's Kickstarter was that Cheiron's Employee Manual was not a stretch goal. I would have paid to get someone to actually write it down :P</div> </div> </div> </div>I always enjoyed their field tactics sections in the supplement books, with regulations about how many you need to do certain things. But it would have been hitting a smaller niche than Ordo and clan fans. Maybe they'll have cut-out sections of it for the fiction in some of the supplements.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}